    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53577" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾰρώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>drowsy, heavy</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄμματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					7.30
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ καρῶδες,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρωσις</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Prorrh.</u>
				1.63
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ καρώδεα</span>
			<i>fits of stupor</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				103
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Coac.</u>
				523
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>causing stupor</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Art.</u>
				31
			</span></i>; <i>soporific</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CA</u>
				2.1
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					14.4
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Trall.
				<u>Febr.</u>
				7
			</span></i>.</div>
